        </div>

        <p class="gallery-note">
          These images illustrate different forms of
          commemoration and change. They do not, by themselves,
          establish what citizens think about those practices.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ==================================================
         SLIDE 5 — UZBEKISTAN PHOTOS 7–9
    ================================================== -->

    <section class="slide" data-title="Uzbekistan: monuments and memorials">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="eyebrow">
