    </section>


    <!-- ==================================================
         SLIDE 7 — CASE SELECTION
    ================================================== -->

    <section class="slide" data-title="Case selection">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="eyebrow">
          Comparative case selection
        </div>

        <h2>
          Why Kazakhstan
          <span class="accent">and Uzbekistan?</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="cards">

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Kazakhstan</h3>

            <p>
              Nazarbayev has been commemorated through
              monuments, place names and institutions.
              The capital was renamed Nur-Sultan in 2019
              and restored to Astana in 2022.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Uzbekistan</h3>

            <p>
              Following Karimov’s death in 2016,
              Uzbekistan established memorial sites
              and annual remembrance practices,
              alongside monuments and named institutions.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <p class="description" style="margin-top: 26px;">
          Both countries offer examples of presidential
          commemoration, while their commemorative
          trajectories differ. Comparing them allows
          me to explore citizens’ interpretations
          across different political contexts and
          formative experiences.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ==================================================
         SLIDE 8 — RESEARCH QUESTION
    ================================================== -->

    <section class="slide" data-title="Research question">
      <div class="container center">

        <div class="eyebrow">
          Research question
        </div>

        <div class="research-question">
          How do citizens in Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan
          <span class="accent">make sense of</span>
          the public commemoration of their first presidents,
          Nursultan Nazarbayev and Islam Karimov?
        </div>

        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">Monuments</span>
          <span class="chip">Place names</span>
          <span class="chip">Memorial sites</span>
          <span class="chip">Official ceremonies</span>
        </div>

        <p class="small" style="margin-top: 30px;">
          Population: citizens of Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan.<br>
          Focus: their interpretations of public commemoration as of 2026.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ==================================================
